<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="eyebrow"><view class="tiny-leaf"></view> 蔬菜观察室 · PHOTO CHECK</view>
    <view class="hero-title">看看蔬菜怎么了</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">从一张照片开始，了解可见症状与照护方向。</view>
    <view class="hero-note">AI 辅助初步识别 · 仅供种植参考</view>
    <view class="leaf-art" aria-hidden="true"><view class="hero-leaf leaf-one"></view><view class="hero-leaf leaf-two"></view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card input-card">
    <view class="section-heading"><text class="step">01</text><text class="section-title">选择本次观察的作物</text><text class="required">必选</text></view>
    <view class="crop-options">
      <button wx:for="{{cropOptions}}" wx:key="id" class="crop-button {{selectedCropId === item.id ? 'crop-selected' : ''}}" data-crop-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCropSelect" disabled="{{busy || choosing}}" aria-label="{{item.name}}" aria-pressed="{{selectedCropId === item.id}}">{{item.name}}</button>
    </view>
    <view class="crop-tip">请选择照片中的作物；大白菜不包括小白菜和甘蓝。选择仅作为分析线索，仍需依据照片核实。</view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="section-heading"><text class="step">02</text><text class="section-title">给它拍张照片</text><text class="required">必选</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!photoPath}}" class="photo-empty">
      <view class="photo-frame"><view class="frame-leaf"></view><view class="frame-line"></view></view>
      <view class="photo-title">把不对劲的地方拍清楚</view>
      <view class="photo-tip">叶片、果实或茎部均可，尽量使用自然光</view>
      <button class="choose-button" bindtap="choosePhoto" disabled="{{busy || choosing}}" loading="{{choosing}}">拍照 / 从相册选择</button>
      <view class="file-tip">单张照片 · JPEG / PNG / WebP · 最大 8 MB</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="photo-selected">
      <image wx:if="{{photoApproved}}" class="photo" src="{{photoPath}}" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="previewPhoto" aria-label="查看所选照片大图"></image>
      <view wx:else class="photo-pending"><view class="photo-title">照片已选择</view><view class="photo-tip">完成内容安全检测后显示照片</view></view>
      <view class="photo-actions"><text class="preview-hint">{{photoApproved ? '点击照片查看大图' : '待检测照片'}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="choosePhoto" disabled="{{busy || choosing}}">更换</button><button class="text-button remove-button" bindtap="removePhoto" disabled="{{busy || choosing}}">移除</button></view>
    </view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="section-heading"><text class="step">03</text><text class="section-title">再补充一点线索</text><text class="optional">选填</text></view>
    <textarea class="description" value="{{description}}" bindinput="onDescriptionInput" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || choosing}}" placeholder="例如：下部叶片先出现黄斑，近两天浇水较多，已持续 3 天……" placeholder-class="placeholder" auto-height="{{false}}" show-confirm-bar="{{false}}" adjust-position="{{true}}" />
    <view class="description-footer"><text>症状出现多久？哪些部位有变化？</text><text>{{description.length}}/500</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="consent"><view class="consent-dot"></view><text>点击识别后，照片和描述将经微信内容安全检测，并发送至云端模型分析；处理期间会短期保存。</text></view>
  <button class="primary-button" bindtap="recognize" disabled="{{busy || choosing || !selectedCropId || !photoPath}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{busy ? '正在识别，请稍候' : (error ? '重新识别' : '开始初步识别')}}<text wx:if="{{!busy}}" class="button-arrow">↗</text></button>

  <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="progress-panel" role="status">
    <view class="progress-title">{{stage === 'checking' ? '正在进行内容安全检测…' : (stage === 'analysing' ? '正在分析可见症状…' : (uploadComplete ? '照片已上传，等待内容安全检测…' : '正在登录并上传照片 ' + uploadProgress + '%'))}}</view>
    <view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{uploadProgress}}%;"></view></view>
    <view class="progress-note">{{stage === 'checking' ? '检测可能需要较长时间，请保持页面打开。' : (stage === 'analysing' ? '分析需要一点时间，请保持页面打开。' : '此进度仅表示照片上传情况。')}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{rejected}}" class="error-panel" role="alert">您提交的内容含违规信息。</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-panel" role="alert"><view class="error-title">这次还没完成</view><view class="error-copy">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{photoPath}}" class="error-hint">照片和描述已保留，可点击上方按钮重试。</view></view>

  <view wx:if="{{resultView}}" class="card result-card">
    <view class="result-eyebrow">本次观察 · 初步结果</view>
    <view class="status-badge status-{{resultView.status}}">{{resultView.label}}</view>
    <view class="crop-assessment">
      <view class="crop-result-name">选择的作物：{{resultView.selectedCropName}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{resultView.conditionalLabel}}" class="conditional-panel"><view class="conditional-title">{{resultView.conditionalLabel}}</view><view>图片无法独立确认作物</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{resultView.detectedCropName}}" class="crop-detected">照片判断的作物：{{resultView.detectedCropName}}</view>
      <view class="crop-reason">{{resultView.crop.reason}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{resultView.reselectGuidance}}" class="reselect-guidance">{{resultView.reselectGuidance}}</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{resultView.disease_name}}" class="disease-name">{{resultView.disease_name}}</view>
    <view class="summary">{{resultView.summary}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{resultView.primaryDisease}}" class="result-section likelihood-section">
      <view class="likelihood-heading"><text class="result-heading">病害可能性</text><text class="estimate-label">模型估计</text></view>
      <view class="primary-candidate">
        <view class="candidate-label">当前疑似病害</view>
        <view class="likelihood-row"><text class="candidate-name">{{resultView.primaryDisease.name}}</text><text class="likelihood-value">{{resultView.primaryDisease.likelihood}}%</text></view>
        <view class="likelihood-track"><view class="likelihood-fill" style="width: {{resultView.primaryDisease.likelihood}}%;"></view></view>
        <view class="cause-reason">{{resultView.primaryDisease.reason}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="alternatives-heading">其他可能病害</view>
      <view wx:if="{{resultView.alternativeDiseases.length}}">
        <view wx:for="{{resultView.alternativeDiseases}}" wx:key="name" class="alternative-candidate">
          <view class="likelihood-row"><text class="candidate-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="likelihood-value">{{item.likelihood}}%</text></view>
          <view class="likelihood-track"><view class="likelihood-fill alternative-fill" style="width: {{item.likelihood}}%;"></view></view>
          <view class="cause-reason">{{item.reason}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:else class="candidate-empty">暂无足够证据列出其他病害。</view>
      <view class="likelihood-notice">以上为模型估计，未经准确率校准，不是确诊概率。仅供候选比较，各项不要求合计 100%；未列出的病害也不能排除。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{resultView.observed_symptoms.length}}" class="result-section"><view class="result-heading">照片里的线索</view><view wx:for="{{resultView.observed_symptoms}}" class="list-row"><text class="bullet">·</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{resultView.possible_causes.length}}" class="result-section"><view class="result-heading">可能的原因</view><view wx:for="{{resultView.possible_causes}}" class="cause"><view class="cause-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="cause-reason">{{item.reason}}</view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{resultView.recommendations.length}}" class="result-section recommendation-panel"><view class="result-heading">接下来可以做什么</view><view wx:for="{{resultView.recommendations}}" class="list-row"><text class="number">{{index + 1}}</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{resultView.follow_up_questions.length}}" class="result-section"><view class="result-heading">进一步确认的小提示</view><view wx:for="{{resultView.follow_up_questions}}" class="list-row"><text class="bullet">·</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="result-notice">{{resultView.notice}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="footer">仔细观察，科学照护<view class="footer-line"></view>每一次发现，都是更好照护的开始</view>
</view>
